# LLM Council

When the user **discusses a task**, asks for **multiple perspectives**, mentions **council** / **совет моделей**, or faces **non-trivial trade-offs**:

1. Read `blocks/dev-os/skills/llm-council/SKILL.md`
2. Run Stage 1 → 2 → 3 (parallel opinions, anonymized review, chairman synthesis)
3. Do not substitute a single quick answer when council was explicitly requested

Skip council for trivial edits, single-file fixes, or when user wants speed over depth.

Source repo: https://github.com/karpathy/llm-council (pattern only — no OpenRouter app in hub).
